 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "15m setup: phase-3 bare 15m CISD (series_open, 2/2 swings, max_wait 3, min_series 1); its protected swing is formed before the decision by construction; stop = protected swing",
   "all timeframes green: last CLOSED 1D, 4H (forex grid) and 1H candles all closed in the trade direction",
   "target = previous completed trading day's high (long) / low (short); require reward >= 2 x risk measured from the confirming close, else no trade ('if 2R is not achievable, wait')",
   "decision window 07:00-12:00 NY; pre-open = decided before 09:30 NY",
   "enter next M1 open; exit at target, stop, or 16:00 NY the same day",
   "gate_test: pre-open vs post-open (09:30-12:00)"
  ],
